    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;The Signal pulses. You answered. Welcome, Contestant.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is the Global VR Challenge.</i>\u00a0Billions watched. Millions applied.\u00a0<strong>You were selected.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a fully adaptive digital arena. Face ever-shifting enemies across procedurally generated zones. Climb the leaderboard. Build your legend.\u00a0<strong>And unlock the mystery of the Black Signal.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 million credits await the one who completes the run. Your avatar is live. Your journey begins now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Engagement rated Platinum. Recovery probability: HIGH. Follow the Signal. The Signal leads to victory.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597380/extras/62febbaf8dacb58466b7cac872d36e4f.avif?t=1751030986\" data-has-big width=800 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE BLACK SIGNAL\u2122</strong>\u00a0<i>An initiative of the Global AI Entertainment Consortium</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the elite ranks of Contestants chosen for the world\u2019s most advanced immersive competition. Experience cutting-edge procedurally generated arenas, real-time adaptive AI opponents, and limitless progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- 25 million credits</strong>\u00a0await the victor. - Climb the\u00a0<strong>Global Leaderboards</strong>. - Discover the ultimate mystery:\u00a0<strong>The Black Signal</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All progress is monitored for quality assurance. All choices are tracked. All glory is earned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;The Signal is real. The challenge is waiting. Access granted.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>#TheBlackSignal #AIChallenge #25MillionCredits</strong></p>",
